{
  "html": "<svg class=\"svg-defs\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs>\n    <symbol id=\"i-close\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-back\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 12H4m6-6-6 6 6 6\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 12 4.5 4.5L19 7\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-download\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 16v5h16v-5\"/></symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"i-search\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"m16 16 5 5\"/></symbol>\n  </defs></svg>\n<dialog id=\"application-dialog\" class=\"large-dialog application-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"application-title\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-top\"><img src=\"/assets/images/logo-white.svg\" alt=\"RMinte\"><button class=\"contact-close\" type=\"button\" data-close aria-label=\"关闭样机申请\"><svg><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg></button></div>\n    <div id=\"application-content\" class=\"application-content\">\n      <form id=\"application-form\" novalidate>\n        <div class=\"application-heading\"><div><h1 id=\"application-title\">样机申请</h1><p>填写借用方、收货信息和借用需求</p></div><span>必填项已标注</span></div>\n        <fieldset class=\"application-group\"><legend>借用方信息</legend><div class=\"field-grid\">\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>主体类型 <em>必填</em></span><select name=\"entity\" id=\"application-entity\" required><option value=\"公司\">企业</option><option value=\"个人\">个人</option></select></label>\n          <label class=\"field\"><span><span id=\"applicant-name-label\">经销商名称 / 公司全称</span> <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"company\" required autocomplete=\"organization\" placeholder=\"填写借用主体的完整名称\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>联系人姓名 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"contact\" required autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"填写联系人姓名\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>联系电话 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" required autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"填写可联系的电话号码\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field email-field\"><span>联系邮箱 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@company.com\" aria-describedby=\"email-help\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field\" data-application-company><span>统一社会信用代码 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"credit\" required></label>\n          <p class=\"email-help span-2\" id=\"email-help\"><strong>邮箱非常重要。</strong>借用协议及相关通知将发送至此邮箱，请务必填写正确、可正常收信的邮箱</p>\n          <label class=\"field\" data-application-company><span>注册地址 <em>必填</em></span><textarea name=\"registeredAddress\" required rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"填写企业注册地址\"></textarea></label>\n          <label class=\"field contact-address-field\"><span>联系地址 <em>必填</em></span><textarea name=\"companyAddress\" required rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"street-address\" placeholder=\"填写可联系到你的完整地址\"></textarea></label>\n        </div></fieldset>\n        <fieldset class=\"application-group\"><legend>收货信息</legend><div class=\"field-grid\">\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>收件人 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"receiver\" required placeholder=\"填写实际收件人\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>收件电话 <em>必填</em></span><input name=\"receiverPhone\" type=\"tel\" required placeholder=\"填写收件联系电话\"></label>\n          <label class=\"field span-2\"><span>收货地址 <em>必填</em></span><textarea name=\"shippingAddress\" required rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"省市区、街道及详细地址\"></textarea></label>\n        </div></fieldset>\n        <fieldset class=\"application-group\"><legend>借用需求</legend><div class=\"field-grid\">\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>申请型号 <em>必填</em></span><select name=\"model\" required data-model-options><option value=\"\">选择所需配置</option></select></label>\n          <label class=\"field\"><span>期望借用天数 <em>必填</em></span><div class=\"input-unit\"><input name=\"days\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[1-9][0-9]*\" required placeholder=\"填写天数，例如 3\" aria-describedby=\"days-help\"><span>天</span></div></label>\n          <p class=\"days-help span-2\" id=\"days-help\">申请天数为1—30天，借期包含厂家寄出和你寄回的运输时间，到期前必须送达厂家<br>具体日期由我们批复</p>\n        </div></fieldset>\n        <section class=\"application-submit\" aria-label=\"协议与提交\">\n          <div class=\"key-terms-heading\"><h2>提交前请确认</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button\" data-view-terms>查看完整借用协议<svg><use href=\"#i-diagonal\"/></svg></button></div>\n          <div id=\"application-key-terms\"><p class=\"agreement-acceptance\">提交即表示同意《RM-01 产品借用协议》及以下重点事项</p><ul class=\"key-terms\">\n            <li><strong>押金及汇款</strong><span>人民币30,000元或按确认邮件固定报价折算的等值美元，确认邮件送达后24小时内汇出，足额到账并完成主体与授权核验后发货</span></li>\n            <li class=\"shipping-emphasis\"><strong>往返运费及保价</strong><span><b>厂家寄出：运费到付，由厂家足额保价；你寄回：自付运费及保价费，并按协议整机价值足额保价</b>，往返运费及保价费均由申请人承担</span></li>\n            <li><strong>归还及延期</strong><span>借期包含往返运输，到期前机器及全部配件须实际送达厂家；延期须提前七个自然日申请，七天及以内借期不接受延期，未获批准仍按原截止时间归还</span></li>\n            <li><strong>逾期与赔偿</strong><span>整机价值由管理员审批时填写，逾期归还和赔偿款逾期支付均按整机价值每日1%计费，同一期间不叠加；乙方责任损坏、缺件或丢失优先结算押金，不足补足</span></li>\n            <li><strong>断电操作</strong><span>磁吸盖板下三个指定接口仅可断电插拔，存储卡以可见序列号登记；带电插拔损坏须承担全新同型号卡费用，无法采购时按协议使用同等技术规格的国际知名品牌替代</span></li>\n            <li><strong>账户信息恢复</strong><span><b>如修改过样机默认账户信息或密码，归还前必须恢复至交付记录所载的初始状态，确保原默认账户及密码可正常登录</b></span></li>\n            <li><strong>邮件知悉及退款</strong><span>协议邮件送达后48小时内回邮知悉，未回复依事先约定视为知悉，已知退信不计时；正常归还后五个工作日内退款，人民币退人民币、美元退美元，有应结款项按协议处理</span></li>\n          </ul></div>\n          <div id=\"availability-notice\" class=\"availability-notice\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>\n          <p id=\"application-error\" class=\"inline-message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"pill primary submit-application\" type=\"submit\">同意协议并继续<svg><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></button>\n          <p class=\"application-privacy\">提交将保存申请、条款版本、重点提示和确认行为，用于借用办理与追溯；个人信息处理方式、保存期限及权利渠道见完整协议</p>\n        </section>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"application-success\" class=\"application-success\" hidden><div class=\"success-icon\"><svg><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></div><h1>申请已提交。</h1><p>工作人员会将确认邮件及协议发至你填写的邮箱。送达后24小时内汇出押金，48小时内回邮知悉。</p><dl><div><dt>申请编号</dt><dd class=\"mono\" id=\"success-id\"></dd></div><div><dt>联系邮箱</dt><dd id=\"success-email\"></dd></div><div><dt>申请天数</dt><dd id=\"success-days\"></dd></div></dl><button class=\"pill primary\" type=\"button\" data-close>返回页面</button></div>\n  </dialog>\n<dialog id=\"confirmation-dialog\" class=\"large-dialog confirmation-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"confirmation-title\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2 id=\"confirmation-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">确认借用申请</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"contact-close\" data-close aria-label=\"关闭申请确认\"><svg><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg></button></div>\n    <div class=\"confirmation-scroll\"><p class=\"muted\">请核对申请信息，再次确认重大费用与责任；确认后才正式提交。</p><dl id=\"confirmation-summary\" class=\"audit-facts\"></dl><div id=\"confirmation-stock\" class=\"availability-notice\" hidden></div><div id=\"confirmation-key-terms\"></div><p class=\"fine\" id=\"confirmation-version\"></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button\" data-view-terms>查看完整借用协议<svg><use href=\"#i-diagonal\"/></svg></button><p class=\"fine\">个人信息仅用于借用办理及必要追溯，保存安排和权利渠道见协议。</p></div>\n    <div class=\"confirmation-actions\"><button class=\"pill ghost\" type=\"button\" data-close>返回修改</button><button id=\"confirm-application\" class=\"pill primary\" type=\"button\" disabled>确认同意并提交申请<svg><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></button></div>\n  </dialog>\n<dialog id=\"agreement-dialog\" class=\"large-dialog agreement-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"agreement-title\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2 id=\"agreement-title\">借用协议</h2><span id=\"agreement-mode\">申请前查看</span><button class=\"contact-close\" type=\"button\" data-close aria-label=\"关闭借用协议\"><svg><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"agreement-scroll\"><p class=\"document-notice\" id=\"document-notice\">在线阅读视图；交付以对应版本的存档PDF为准</p><article id=\"agreement-document\" class=\"agreement-document\"></article></div><div class=\"agreement-footer\"><p id=\"agreement-footer-note\">固定条款在申请时展示，实际交付信息由管理员批复填入。</p><button class=\"pill primary\" type=\"button\" data-close>返回</button></div></dialog>\n"
}
